      "message": "This change in the constructor properties for the `PatchFile` class have caused a regression affecting the email notifications for comments on unchanged files.\n\n### Steps to Reproduce\n1. `user1` creates a change.\n2. `user1` adds a comment on an unchanged file `foo.txt`.\n3. `foo.txt` becomes part of patchset N.\n4. `user2` replies to `user1`\u0027s comment in patchset N.\n\n### Expected Behavior\nAn email is sent to `user1` with the following content:\n```\nAttention is currently required from: Administrator.\n\nView Change\n\n1 comment:\n\nFile foo.txt:\n\nPatch Set #1, Line 1: this is a test file\n\nme as admin added this comment\nme as user1 added this comment\n\nTo view, visit change 21. To unsubscribe, or for help writing mail filters, visit settings.\n```\n\n### Observed Behavior\nThe email sent to `user1` is missing the inline comment content and looks like this:\n```\nAttention is currently required from: Administrator.\n\nView Change\n\n1 comment:\n\nFile foo.txt:\n\nTo view, visit change 21. To unsubscribe, or for help writing mail filters, visit settings.\n```\n\n### Root Cause\nThe change introduced a new constructor property `Map\u003cString, FileDiffOutput\u003e modifiedFiles`, replacing the previous `PatchList patchList`. As a result, unchanged files such as `foo.txt` are not included in the `modifiedFiles` map, leading to the following exception:\n\n```\n[2025-01-03T16:27:58.472+01:00] [SendEmail-1[java.util.concurrent.ScheduledThreadPoolExecutor$ScheduledFutureTask@71f85796[Not completed, task \u003d java.util.concurrent.Executors$RunnableAdapter@3f158db8[Wrapped task \u003d com.google.gerrit.server.logging.LoggingContextAwareRunnable@3b5bb5eb]]]] WARN  com.google.gerrit.server.mail.send.CommentSender : Cannot load a.txt from e0d49200bdf776727efb349922cae9e4634baf0f in test-bug [CONTEXT project\u003d\"test-bug\" request\u003d\"REST /changes/*/revisions/*/review\" ]\norg.eclipse.jgit.errors.MissingObjectException: Missing unknown 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000\n   at org.eclipse.jgit.internal.storage.file.WindowCursor.open(WindowCursor.java:136)\n   at org.eclipse.jgit.lib.ObjectReader.open(ObjectReader.java:212)\n   at org.eclipse.jgit.revwalk.RevWalk.parseAny(RevWalk.java:1075)\n   at org.eclipse.jgit.revwalk.RevWalk.parseCommit(RevWalk.java:985)\n   at com.google.gerrit.server.patch.PatchFile.\u003cinit\u003e(PatchFile.java:72)\n   at com.google.gerrit.server.mail.send.CommentSender.getGroupedInlineComments(CommentSender.java:212)\n   at com.google.gerrit.server.mail.send.CommentSender.getCommentGroupsTemplateData(CommentSender.java:378)\n   at com.google.gerrit.server.mail.send.CommentSender.setupSoyContext(CommentSender.java:499)\n   at com.google.gerrit.server.mail.send.OutgoingEmail.init(OutgoingEmail.java:318)\n   at com.google.gerrit.server.mail.send.NotificationEmail.init(NotificationEmail.java:45)\n   at com.google.gerrit.server.mail.send.ChangeEmail.init(ChangeEmail.java:191)\n   at com.google.gerrit.server.mail.send.ReplyToChangeSender.init(ReplyToChangeSender.java:35)\n   at com.google.gerrit.server.mail.send.CommentSender.init(CommentSender.java:142)\n   at com.google.gerrit.server.mail.send.OutgoingEmail.sendImpl(OutgoingEmail.java:133)\n   at com.google.gerrit.server.mail.send.OutgoingEmail.lambda$send$0(OutgoingEmail.java:107)\n   at com.github.rholder.retry.AttemptTimeLimiters$NoAttemptTimeLimit.call(AttemptTimeLimiters.java:78)\n   at com.github.rholder.retry.Retryer.call(Retryer.java:160)\n   at com.google.gerrit.server.update.RetryHelper.executeWithTimeoutCount(RetryHelper.java:564)\n   at com.google.gerrit.server.update.RetryHelper.execute(RetryHelper.java:507)\n   at com.google.gerrit.server.update.RetryableAction.call(RetryableAction.java:173)\n   at com.google.gerrit.server.mail.send.OutgoingEmail.send(OutgoingEmail.java:111)\n   at com.google.gerrit.server.change.EmailReviewComments.run(EmailReviewComments.java:148)\n   at com.google.gerrit.server.logging.LoggingContextAwareRunnable.run(LoggingContextAwareRunnable.java:113)\n   at java.base/java.util.concurrent.Executors$RunnableAdapter.call(Executors.java:515)\n   at java.base/java.util.concurrent.FutureTask.run(FutureTask.java:264)\n   at java.base/java.util.concurrent.ScheduledThreadPoolExecutor$ScheduledFutureTask.run(ScheduledThreadPoolExecutor.java:304)\n   at com.google.gerrit.server.git.WorkQueue$Task.run(WorkQueue.java:612)\n   at java.base/java.util.concurrent.ThreadPoolExecutor.runWorker(ThreadPoolExecutor.java:1128)\n   at java.base/java.util.concurrent.ThreadPoolExecutor$Worker.run(ThreadPoolExecutor.java:628)\n   at java.base/java.lang.Thread.run(Thread.java:829)\n```\n\nThis exception prevents the email from including the inline comment content.\n\n### Next Steps\nI have logged the issue 387440281 for further investigation and resolution.",
